1. ContentRouter + tests (this is the foundation — get it right first).
1. Deduplicator + tests.
1. Fallback compressors (JSON crusher, code skeletonizer, caveman prose) + tests — these must work standalone before any optional dependency is touched.
1. Optional-dependency wrappers (headroom, llmlingua) with import guards + tests using mocks.
1. HistoryManager, ToolSchemaPruner, CacheAligner + tests.
1. QualityGate + property tests.
1. Adapters (sync, async_queue), Optimizer facade, CLI, stats.
1. Golden-file regression fixture + benchmark + README.

